title: Count Incoming Packets Per Protocol via XDP
name: bpf_xdp.stp
keywords: network xdp bpf
subsystem: network
description: Decode the ethertype of incoming packets using an XDP program
  attached to loopback, accumulate per-protocol packet and byte counts, print
  the sorted table shortly after, while passing packets to the network stack.
test_support: stap --runtime=bpf -p4 bpf_xdp.stp
test_check: stap --runtime=bpf -p4 bpf_xdp.stp
test_installcheck: stap --runtime=bpf bpf_xdp.stp -T 3
